_scratch/
# Workflow scratch (ledgers, briefs, review packages). It was previously hidden
# only by this machine's global excludesfile, which does not travel with a
# clone — so on any other checkout it would show up as untracked and could be
# committed by a wildcard `git add`.
.superpowers/
node_modules/
dist/
dist-guard7/
# Rscript opens a default PDF device, so any analysis script that draws leaves
# this behind whether or not it saved a figure.
Rplots.pdf
# Per-shard intermediates from a `--shard=<ratio>` run. The merged CSV is the
# committed artifact and the runner's check 5 proves the shard boundary was
# inert, so these are regenerable scratch, not results.
experiments/*.shard-*.csv
